{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>And their head you shall not lift among the children of Israel.</b> For their count is not equivalent, since those are counted from twenty years and upward, while the Levites from a month old and from thirty years old, as is explained in this portion and in the portion of Naso. Another interpretation: because none of them goes out to army service, but only the guards and those encamped around the Tabernacle, in the manner of one who sits over the vessels."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:12.158065030Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}